        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-OCEAN-002-C03",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "Mast:SetSailForce仅写sail_force。CalcSailForce按inverted、is_sail_raised和furlunits比例输出该值或0；CalcMaxVelocity独立按相同帆状态比例读取max_velocity。mast构造零延时按当前平台SetBoat并登记到船masts；malbatross prefab的master设置自己的sail_force/max_velocity及反向部署模式。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "OC-S18",
            "OC-S20"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-OCEAN-002-C04",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "BoatPhysics逐帧汇总各mast的CalcSailForce并乘阻力源的sailforcemodifier。GetMaxVelocity把非零mast容量升序排序后以1、0.7逐项折减，磁吸容量另组同类聚合；再乘船max_velocity和各boatdrag.max_velocity_mod，最后裁全局允许上限。OnUpdate安排磁吸、帆力与阻力，按船旋转转向量后调用Physics:SetMotorVel。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "OC-S15",
            "OC-S16"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-OCEAN-002-C05",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "boatphysics的实体睡眠入口CloseAllSails逐个调用mast:CloseSail；船PhysicsSleep停止其更新、Wake重新启动。原版mast烧毁回调先从船RemoveMast并移除rudder，再RemoveComponent(mast)。BoatPhysics保存的是目标方向、旋转偏移与速度分量。",
